    {
      "id": "concepts-python/concurrency-unit",
      "chapterId": "concepts-python/04-modules-concurrency",
      "title": "并发单元",
      "kind": "concept",
      "summary": "线程 / 进程 / 协程三选一，而且线程被 GIL 限制着",
      "snippets": {
        "java": {
          "lang": "java",
          "equivalence": "divergent",
          "code": "Thread t = new Thread(() -> work());     // 真并行，且**共享内存**\nt.start();\nt.join();\n\nvar pool = java.util.concurrent.Executors.newFixedThreadPool(4);\npool.submit(() -> work());\n\n// Java 21 虚拟线程：数量可以开到百万级，但仍是共享内存模型\ntry (var exec = java.util.concurrent.Executors.newVirtualThreadPerTaskExecutor()) {\n    exec.submit(() -> work());\n}",
          "html": "<pre class=\"shiki css-variables\" style=\"background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">Thread</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> t </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\"> new</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\"> Thread(() </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">-></span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\"> work())</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">;     </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">// 真并行，且**共享内存**</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">t</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">start</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">t</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">join</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">var</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> pool </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> java</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">util</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">concurrent</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">Executors</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">newFixedThreadPool</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">4</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">pool</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">submit</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">(() </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">-></span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\"> work()</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">// Java 21 虚拟线程：数量可以开到百万级，但仍是共享内存模型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">try</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> (</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">var</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> exec </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> java</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">util</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">concurrent</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">Executors</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">newVirtualThreadPerTaskExecutor</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">    exec</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">submit</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">(() </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">-></span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\"> work()</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">}</span></span></code></pre>",
          "lineCount": 11,
          "notes": [],
          "reviewState": "draft",
          "provenanceOrigin": "llm",
          "bodyHtml": "<p><strong>共享内存的真线程</strong> —— 并行是真的，代价是共享可变状态必须自己同步\n（<code>synchronized</code>、<code>java.util.concurrent</code>、<code>volatile</code>）。</p>\n<p>这与 Python 的处境正好相反：那边有 GIL 挡着，很多竞态根本不会出现，\n所以&quot;这段代码是不是线程安全的&quot;在那边可以不问，在这里必须问。\n虚拟线程降低了线程的成本，但<strong>没有改变共享内存这个模型</strong> ——\n竞态该有还是有。</p>\n"
